                            {
                                "example_id": "e814b4d2-8a75-4ec6-a6c6-6bd82b8a0c58",
                                "sense_id": "dfe2d460-e996-37dd-a8d1-486f0239678c",
                                "text": "“I guess I’m having an Aleppo moment,” Johnson said, trying to turn the moment into a bit of self-deprecating humor. Earlier this month, Johnson was ridiculed after being quizzed about the besieged city that has become a focal point of Syria’s civil war and coming up blank."
